type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Ensure you provide a <b>valid email address<\/b> so we can notify you once your account has been approved and activated.<\/span><\/p><ul><li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NO minimum order size requirement.\u00a0 <\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">$2,500 monthly commitment.<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Drop ship capabilities for individual orders.<\/span><\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Please email us a copy of your<b> Sales Tax Exemption form.<\/b><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a57321 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6a57321\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-723434c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"723434c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form-1024x682.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2302\" alt=\"Man looking at this computer\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form-1024x682.png 1024w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form-768x512.png 768w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form-600x400.png 600w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/application-form.png 1297w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024